---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About">
  <header class="page-head">
    <p class="eyebrow">about this community</p>
    <h1>About ai.swegrowth.id</h1>
  </header>
  <p>
    ai.swegrowth.id is a community space for sharing practical AI skills:
    workflows, prompts, and configurations that people have found useful.
  </p>
  <p>
    Browse skills by topic, explore useful AI tools, and catch up on the AI
    News Digest. Community members can also share a skill
    or add an idea to the Wanted List.
  </p>
  <p>
    The collection is built by the community. <a href="/help">Read the guide</a>,
    or browse the site code: <a href="https://github.com/swegrowthid/sweg-ai-lists">Frontend</a>
    · <a href="https://github.com/swegrowthid/sweg-ai-lists-backend">Backend</a>.
  </p>
</Base>
